  "modifications": [
    "Inline JavaScript, CSS, SVG and audio files for self-contained static HTML; retain original source comments and add change notices.",
    "Use the original bundled Tone.js 0.6.1 (r6) locally instead of the Harmonics remote Tone URL.",
    "Correct standalone Harmonics mode; two entry pages select fixed modes 0 (Harmonics) and 1 (Strings), rather than the upstream query parser which could only choose Strings.",
    "Correct Harmonics/Strings touchStarted(event) to touchStarted(e), and undefined mode to MODE in touch-cancel handling.",
    "Replace legacy iOS-only audio overlays with native AudioContext.resume on first pointer/touch/key gesture; suspend on visibility loss/blur and close on pagehide.",
    "Support parent atlas-original-stop message from the parent frame only.",
    "Give the original Sound Waves zoom control an accessible name, focus style and Enter/Space activation.",
    "Show an explicit WebGL-unavailable message with original/site source links when the original renderer cannot create its WebGL context; no alternate simplified renderer is substituted.",
    "Omit unused Deku and keys imports from Sound Waves module 80 and prune their 30 unreachable Browserify modules; the active original piano, renderer, shaders and audio remain.",
    "Remove obsolete separate sourceMappingURL from the inline Sound Waves distribution; source is pinned by upstream commit."
  ],
  "original_assets_no_separate_exception_found": true,
